# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a fully functional, intelligent, secure, and premium AI Customer Support Chatbot for the existing Deshi Gee e-commerce website using Google Gemini API and Next.js.

The chatbot must work as an official virtual customer support representative of Deshi Gee.

Its primary purpose is to help website visitors with:
- Deshi Gee brand information.
- Our single ghee product.
- Available product weight variations.
- Current product prices.
- Product features and descriptions.
- Ingredients and production information.
- Product usage and storage instructions.
- Product availability and stock.
- Current offers and discounts.
- Delivery charges and delivery policies.
- Payment methods.
- Order placement.
- Order tracking.
- Return and replacement policies.
- Business location.
- Contact number and WhatsApp.
- Business hours.
- Customer support.

IMPORTANT BUSINESS STRUCTURE:

Deshi Gee is a single-product e-commerce business.

There must be ONLY ONE main product listing: Deshi Gee.

Different weights such as 250g, 500g, and 1kg must be treated as weight variations of the same product, NOT separate products or different ghee categories.

The chatbot must understand this business structure and never introduce other product varieties that are not officially configured.

The chatbot must be restricted to Deshi Gee-related conversations. It must not behave like a general-purpose AI assistant.

