# 12. CUSTOMER ORDER FLOW — FUNCTIONAL ORDER PLACEMENT

The chatbot must help customers place orders directly through the chat interface.

This is an important conversion feature.

When a customer expresses buying intent, begin the order conversation naturally.

Example:

Customer: "আমি ৫০০ গ্রামের ঘি অর্ডার করতে চাই।"

